Sounds good, I understand wanting hp to matter, it was just that they are so high as a group, that they become an auto pick to a degree. If your choices in the draft matter more than your play in terms of scoring it gets a bit funky. Personally I was thinking 1/3 of their hp, harder math but still lets their bigger hp shine since they also are more vulnerable to AOE which was part of their design. But it&#39;s not like this is a grand tournament or anything, more just goofing around.

